{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51833","headline":"题含虚洞二首 二 · 独孤均","name":"题含虚洞二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"扪萝攀蹬步欹危，历览幽岩骇怪奇。\n泉石膏肓传亦久，神仙窟宅到何迟。\n真人鹿引非无路，洞府龙升自有时。\n但觉尘缘挹绝景，踌躇落笔媿题诗。\n（以上《康熙徽州府志》二《婺源·山川》）（〖1〗光绪《婺源县志》卷六十二作独孤筠。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"独孤均","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51833.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51833","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}